set.body:
Cold review of fcba42c50 (S4, ADR 0026), finding 3+5. Add killing tests for guards that currently survive mutation:
- hypothesis whose subject is the twin itself (promotion.scala:359);
- opposite-polarity rival inside the nested speech context (any-depth rule, :352-357);
- text-family overlap and the cross-family `case _ => false` (:326-332): a text mention against anchored support must refuse;
- role-set equality in sameContent (:343): rival differing only in participants does not contest;
- modelDigest completeness: one holdsIn test per read field (polarity, modality, support, context, lemma, frame), editing the twin in place;
- positive path for an Asserted twin.
Drop the vacuous assertion at SpeechPromotionSuite.scala:231. Acceptance: each listed mutant fails a named test.
